# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IPUMS USA microdata is NOT redistributable under the IPUMS terms of use, and
# the raw extract exceeds GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit regardless. Anyone
# replicating this project must pull their own extract; see Data/README.md for
# the exact sample, years, and variable list needed.
# (Directories are re-included via `!Data/**/` so that git can descend into
# them to find the .gitkeep placeholders; git cannot re-include a file whose
# parent directory is itself excluded.)
Data/**
!Data/**/
!Data/README.md
!Data/**/.gitkeep

# Any stray data files placed outside Data/
*.dta
*.dta.gz
*.csv.gz
*.sav
*.por

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Stata
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor swap files (e.g. ~01_Data_Cleaning.do.stswp)
~*.stswp
*.stswp
# Saved estimates and temporary matrices
*.ster
*.stbcal
# Note: .log files are intentionally NOT ignored. They are committed as a
# record of the exact output behind the tables in the paper.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# R / RStudio
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
.Renviron
*.Rproj.user

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Quarto
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/.quarto/
*_cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LaTeX intermediates (Paper/)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.lof
*.lot
*.out
*.synctex.gz
*.toc

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS / editor cruft
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*~
*.swp
